# DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash, one Station (right), same-session sidecar A/B on PUBLIC REAL TEXT, arm A: GB300 + RTX PRO 6000 b12x sidecar (MEGA_PEER=2, MEGA_COLD_TRT=0, rowmap-mix-v1).
# 2026-10-09 11:15-11:36 PT. Three prompt sets back to back on one boot: long (CNN/DailyMail, 8K in, 1,024 forced out),
# short (ShareGPT first turns, natural output <= 1,024), random (8,192 random ids, 1,024 forced; control).
